" Minimal vifmrc for the Dracula setup.
"
" vifm ships with built-in defaults, so this file only selects the
" Dracula colourscheme; add your own settings below. The palette
" itself comes from ~/.Xresources, so the colourscheme uses the
" 8/16 ANSI colour names.
"
" See the LICENSE file at the top of the project tree for copyright
" and license details.

colorscheme dracula
